
## Docker

This project also ships a `Dockerfile` and `docker-compose.yml` (PostgreSQL and Redis,
plus an optional Elasticsearch service under the `es` profile):

    docker compose up --build
    # or, with Elasticsearch too:
    docker compose --profile es up --build

`docker-compose.yml` reads `.env` (via `env_file: .env`) and falls back to SQLite if
`POSTGRES_HOST` is unset, same as running without Docker.
